    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each location is a new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore</strong>, listen, react\u2026 <strong>or die</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A visual compass</i>, immersive <i>ambient</i> sound, and <i>original music</i> guide you through the dark monastery halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gravure-style <strong>hand-drawn images</strong> briefly pierce the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Put on your headphones.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sound is your only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Voice acting</i> channels late-20th-century <i>B-movie vibes</i> to set the tone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll start with a short tutorial \u2014 then, <strong>you\u2019re on your own.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>15 achievements to unlock.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Challenging by design. Satisfying by intent.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the tough classics of the \u201880s and \u201890s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We won\u2019t reveal too much, but here\u2019s <strong>what awaits you</strong> in the first few locations\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 1 \u2013 Run. Or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 2 \u2013 Just reach the door at the end. Simple? Maybe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 3 \u2013 Talk\u2026 but know this: one person here might still be breathing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 4 \u2013 Trust the cat, not the human. Or \u2014 yeah, die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 5 \u2013 Accept the teleport. Or\u2026 well, don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Location 6 \u2013 The way out is hard to find. Dying? Not so much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most won\u2019t reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you do, the finale may surprise you \u2014 and remind you that <strong>life is worth living</strong>, even if it takes twenty deaths to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Still curious? Time to begin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.poster.avif?t=1751456715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.webm?t=1751456715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
