2019t reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you do, the finale may surprise you \u2014 and remind you that <strong>life is worth living</strong>, even if it takes twenty deaths to prove it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Still curious? Time to begin.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.poster.avif?t=1751456715\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561920/extras/7c1115c5fdfca7fff03572d68135a7b1.webm?t=1751456715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
